-- title:
--   Twentyseven-branch Syracuse descent remaining after 525 further certified progressions modulo $2^{20}$
-- statement:
--   Let $T(n)$ be the odd part of $3n+1$, and $T^t$ its $t$-fold iterate. Suppose $n$ satisfies every congruence and exclusion hypothesis of the [twentyseven-branch residual descent theorem modulo $2^{18}$](https://prove2.me/theorems/bcbfb4d5-ae6b-4b5f-9022-a71426797d08), repeated verbatim in the formal statement. In particular,
--
--   $$
--   n\equiv 27\pmod{32},
--   $$
--
--   and $n\bmod 262144$ avoids the 961-residue list of the [proved uniform eleven-step descent theorem](https://prove2.me/theorems/b4cf0c47-c078-4235-b853-32b5a518517e). Let $R$ be the explicit list of 525 residues modulo $2^{20}=1048576$ of the uniform twelve-step descent theorem `syracuse_descent_twentyseven_mod32_mod1048576_step12`, repeated verbatim in the formal statement, and add the condition
--
--   $$
--   n\bmod 1048576\notin R.
--   $$
--
--   The remaining open assertion is
--
--   $$
--   \exists t\in\mathbb N,\qquad T^t(n)<n.
--   $$
--
--   **Role.** The parent's hypotheses leave 1386 residue classes modulo $2^{18}$, i.e. 5544 classes modulo $2^{20}$. The list $R$ consists of the 525 of them certified by the published theorem [`CollatzFrontier.syracuse_terminal_budget_of_descent`](https://prove2.me/theorems/2513a4d3-77eb-4b93-9876-33755812122c) with exponent budget $20$; this child asks for descent on the complementary 5019 classes modulo $2^{20}$, with neither the starting value nor the descent time bounded. Parent, list theorem and this child are related by a plain case split on $n\bmod 2^{20}\in R$. The statement remains unproved; it is an explicitly unresolved child, not a claim that the parent or the Collatz conjecture is solved.
--
--   **Formalization Note.** The map is the existing `syracuseStep`. All inherited hypotheses keep the parent's names, order and literals; the single new hypothesis `h1048576` is nonmembership in the same literal `List ℕ` as in the supporting list theorem. The recursion-depth setting only supports elaboration of the long literals.
-- source:
--   Original computation of this contribution (explicit certified refinement of https://prove2.me/theorems/bcbfb4d5-ae6b-4b5f-9022-a71426797d08 from modulus 2^18 to 2^20; the residue table is computed, not quoted from the literature). Method: residue-class descent via the Proved theorem CollatzFrontier.syracuse_terminal_budget_of_descent, https://prove2.me/theorems/2513a4d3-77eb-4b93-9876-33755812122c; exact Syracuse definition https://prove2.me/theorems/2d5fcb43-85b2-4d75-beb8-3e236e66eac3. Packaging follows the modulus-2^18 refinement syracuse_descent_progressions_mod262144, https://prove2.me/theorems/b4cf0c47-c078-4235-b853-32b5a518517e.

